    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/09fd6252abc509a793b12993dc1ad541.poster.avif?t=1755194223\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/09fd6252abc509a793b12993dc1ad541.webm?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/09fd6252abc509a793b12993dc1ad541.mp4?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 &quot;In times of boredom, there's only one logical thing to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 ...travel to another dimension, recreationally!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/86eb8ae815a64c5267a667464021fe48.poster.avif?t=1755194223\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/86eb8ae815a64c5267a667464021fe48.webm?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/86eb8ae815a64c5267a667464021fe48.mp4?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <i>- A. Wandereye (probably)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fourmiworld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fourmiworld is a free game</strong> all about exploring a strange world orbiting a dying star. Along the way you'll discover the remains of a lost civilization, encounter bizarre creatures, unlock tools to aid your expedition, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to support us, consider checking out the <strong>Wandereye's Writings DLC</strong>. It isn't necessary, but we recommend it if you want the definitive Fourmiworld experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/dd5856bc64779ad8f55b0dde52f5a042.poster.avif?t=1755194223\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/dd5856bc64779ad8f55b0dde52f5a042.webm?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/dd5856bc64779ad8f55b0dde52f5a042.mp4?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/96b9c10bad9d901d81d3cfa2c48bca6c.poster.avif?t=1755194223\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/96b9c10bad9d901d81d3cfa2c48bca6c.webm?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/96b9c10bad9d901d81d3cfa2c48bca6c.mp4?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Should you play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you <strong>enjoy at least 7 of the following points</strong>, we think you'll really click with <strong>Fourmiworld</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games with <strong>destructible environments</strong> and <strong>secrets</strong> to discover.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world <strong>exploration</strong> and<strong> nonlinear</strong> progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insects</strong>, bugs and Sci-Fi <strong>ecosystems.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piecing together the <strong>history</strong> of a long-gone <strong>alien race.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atypical artstyles</strong>, collage, <strong>girls</strong> with flowers for eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing stronger</strong> and gaining <strong>abilities</strong> to better navigate your environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games that <strong>don't hold your hand</strong> and just let you<strong> figure things out.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric</strong>, ambient <strong>music that adapts</strong> to where you are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized</strong> experiences, seeing things other players <strong>will not see.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The word &quot;Frondosity&quot; invokes a certain joy in you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/be855452409cbb4466e5e1342f27efd0.poster.avif?t=1755194223\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/be855452409cbb4466e5e1342f27efd0.webm?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/be855452409cbb4466e5e1342f27efd0.mp4?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/9d59907dcc5d0379b4d1e6bc66f17022.poster.avif?t=1755194223\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/9d59907dcc5d0379b4d1e6bc66f17022.webm?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/9d59907dcc5d0379b4d1e6bc66f17022.mp4?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspirations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These games <strong>inspired us</strong> a lot during development. We think you should give the game a try if you <strong>enjoy at least two of these:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metroid - </strong>Game-altering upgrades &amp; lonesome alien atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terraria - </strong>Digging anywhere &amp; obtaining resources to get new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hylics - </strong>Surrealistic stylization &amp; unconventional vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yume Nikki - </strong>Exploring exactly how you want to &amp; seeing weird/cool/scary things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starseed Pilgrim - </strong>Lack of hand-holding &amp; tile interaction aspects.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/09fd6252abc509a793b12993dc1ad541.poster.avif?t=1755194223\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/09fd6252abc509a793b12993dc1ad541.webm?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/09fd6252abc509a793b12993dc1ad541.mp4?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 &quot;In times of boredom, there's only one logical thing to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 ...travel to another dimension, recreationally!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/86eb8ae815a64c5267a667464021fe48.poster.avif?t=1755194223\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/86eb8ae815a64c5267a667464021fe48.webm?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/86eb8ae815a64c5267a667464021fe48.mp4?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <i>- A. Wandereye (probably)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fourmiworld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fourmiworld is a free game</strong> all about exploring a strange world orbiting a dying star. Along the way you'll discover the remains of a lost civilization, encounter bizarre creatures, unlock tools to aid your expedition, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to support us, consider checking out the <strong>Wandereye's Writings DLC</strong>. It isn't necessary, but we recommend it if you want the definitive Fourmiworld experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/dd5856bc64779ad8f55b0dde52f5a042.poster.avif?t=1755194223\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/dd5856bc64779ad8f55b0dde52f5a042.webm?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/dd5856bc64779ad8f55b0dde52f5a042.mp4?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/96b9c10bad9d901d81d3cfa2c48bca6c.poster.avif?t=1755194223\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/96b9c10bad9d901d81d3cfa2c48bca6c.webm?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/96b9c10bad9d901d81d3cfa2c48bca6c.mp4?t=1755194223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Should you play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you <strong>enjoy at least 7 of the following points</strong>, we think you'll really click with <strong>Fourmiworld</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games with <strong>destructible environments</strong> and <strong>secrets</strong> to discover.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world <strong>exploration</strong> and<strong> nonlinear</strong> progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insects</strong>, bugs and Sci-Fi <strong>ecosystems.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piecing together the <strong>history</strong> of a long-gone <strong>alien race.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atypical artstyles</strong>, collage, <strong>girls</strong> with flowers for eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing stronger</strong> and gaining <strong>abilities</strong> to better navigate your environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games that <strong>don't hold your hand</strong> and just let you<strong> figure things out.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric</strong>, ambient <strong>music that adapts</strong> to where you are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized</strong> experiences, seeing things other players <strong>will not see.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The word &quot;Frondosity&quot; invokes a certain joy in you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/be855452409cbb4466e5e1342f27efd0.poster.avif?t=1755194223\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste